{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">GET-BYTE function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309566","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GET-BYTE-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GET-BYTE-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"GET-BYTE-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">GET-BYTE function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-BYTE-function__section_N10031_N1002E_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns the unsigned 1 byte value at the specified memory\nlocation as an INTEGER value. </p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-BYTE-function__syntax_GC18ML2693435\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d64878e103\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"GET-BYTE-function__idGDL2HL2671056\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>GET-BYTE ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">source</var> , <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">source</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A function or variable that returns a RAW or MEMPTR value. If <var class=\"keyword varname\">source</var> is\nthe Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>), GET-BYTE returns the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>).</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An integer value greater than 0 that indicates the byte position\nwhere you want to find the information. If <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> is greater\nthan the length of <var class=\"keyword varname\">source</var>, the AVM returns the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>).\nIf <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> is less than 1, the AVM generates\na run-time error.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-BYTE-function__examples_GC18MM2693451\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d64878e183\">Examples</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">In\nthis example, the RAW function goes to the Customer field in the non-OpenEdge database.\nThe GET-BYTE function accesses the first byte and stores the integer\nvalue of that byte in the variable ix. The procedure then tests the\nvalue, if the integer value is 83 (the character code value for\nS), the AVM displays the Customer Name.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-rawget.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"GET-BYTE-function__idGDL2HM2671063\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>/* You must connect to a non-OpenEdge database to run this procedure */\nDEFINE VARIABLE ix AS INTEGER NO-UNDO.\n\nFOR EACH Customer:\n  ix = <strong class=\"ph b\">GET-BYTE(RAW(Customer.Name), 1).</strong>\n  IF ix = 83 THEN\n    DISPLAY Customer.Name.\nEND.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <p class=\"p\">The next procedure sets up a MEMPTR region with\na character string and uses the GET-BYTE function to display the\ncharacter code value of each character in the string:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-mptget.p</strong></p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"GET-BYTE-function__idGDL2HN2671069\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE mptr AS MEMPTR  NO-UNDO.\nDEFINE VARIABLE cnt  AS INTEGER NO-UNDO.\n\nASSIGN\n  SET-SIZE(mptr)      = LENGTH(&quot;DANIEL&quot;) + 1\n  PUT-STRING(mptr, 1) = &quot;DANIEL&quot;.\n\nREPEAT cnt = 1 TO LENGTH(&quot;DANIEL&quot;):\n  DISPLAY <strong class=\"ph b\">GET-BYTE(mptr, cnt).</strong>\nEND.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-BYTE-function__notes_GC18MO2693459\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d64878e253\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">For\nmore information on using the MEMPTR and RAW data types, see <cite class=\"cite\">OpenEdge\nDevelopment: Programming Interfaces</cite>.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">You can use the alternative keyword GETBYTE instead of GET-BYTE.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-BYTE-function__see-also_GC18MP2693465\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d64878e271\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LENGTH-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LENGTH-function.html\">LENGTH function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PUT-BYTE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PUT-BYTE-statement.html\">PUT-BYTE statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RAW-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RAW-function.html\">RAW function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RAW-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RAW-statement.html\">RAW statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SET-SIZE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SET-SIZE-statement.html\">SET-SIZE statement</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-BITS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-BITS-function.html\">GET-BITS function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-BYTE-ORDER-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-BYTE-ORDER-function.html\">GET-BYTE-ORDER function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309566","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"GET-BYTE function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-BYTE-function.html","type":"Manual"}